\frametitle{Backup slides}
Sometimes, it is useful to add slides at the end of your presentation to refer to during audience questions.

^^I^^IThe best way to do this is to include \verb|\usepackage{appendixnumberbeamer}| in your preamble and call \verb|\appendix| before your backup slides.

^^I^^I\themename{} will automatically turn off slide numbering and progress bars for slides in the appendix.
